{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "seating-chart-api-tests-2025",
		"name": "Seating Chart API Tests",
		"description": "Comprehensive test collection for Seating Chart API endpoints.\n\n**Phase 6.1.2: Seating Chart API Endpoints**\n\nThis collection tests all 14 seating chart endpoints including:\n- Seating chart CRUD operations\n- Table layout management (single and bulk)\n- Seat assignment operations\n- Auto-assignment algorithms (fill_tables, distribute)\n- Statistics and analytics\n- Error handling and validation\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Import the Seating-Chart-Local environment\n3. Set only the event_id variable - guest IDs are auto-populated!\n4. Ensure backend is running on http://localhost:8000\n5. Run the \"1. Setup & Authentication\" folder first\n6. Execute requests sequentially or run entire collection\n\n**Features:**\n- 23 requests across 6 folders\n- ~115 automated test assertions\n- Auto-populates guest IDs from API\n- Auto-saves IDs for request chaining\n- Bearer token authentication\n- Comprehensive error scenarios\n\n**Documentation:** See Seating-Chart-TESTING-GUIDE.md",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{access_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
